{"title":"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 29","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In this figure <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/65114c9cc25c26617310cd7f661903dca0e4d3c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle RFS=\\angle FDR$\" width=\"134\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/3/6838f9786fbaa4deaa46148e7b1a5303c9fdb7f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$FD=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"63\" height=\"13\" /> inches, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/5/615e2eed312f6fe7d5fdd762b5c4117b9c495e2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DR=6$\" width=\"62\" height=\"12\" /> inches, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/7/5a7436fb93b790f5be4af630f1b56b4abf98133e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$FR=5$\" width=\"61\" height=\"12\" /> inches, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/d/e6d9fa93a77091fa024574279dec5d2bf060d0bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$FS=7\\dfrac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"71\" height=\"37\" /> inches. The length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/3/7631e00d1deb6ad3d55301906009f15d342e412a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$RS$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" />, in inches, is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/3/c0313e6eaea2b2881d3f5c08e15d931a0ff40fc3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }\\text{undetermined}\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }4\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }5\\dfrac{1}{2}\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }6\\qquad\\textbf{(E) }6\\dfrac{1}{4}\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"505\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/4/324a10fde845917f61d1cbb9e911e6cb896241df.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] import olympiad;  draw((0,0)--7.5*dir(0)); draw((0,0)--5*dir(55)); draw((0,0)--4*dir(140)); draw(4*dir(140)--5*dir(55)--7.5*dir(0)); markscalefactor=0.1; draw(anglemark((0,0),4*dir(140),5*dir(55))); draw(anglemark(7.5*dir(0),(0,0),5*dir(55))); label(&quot;$F$&quot;,(0,0),dir(240)); label(&quot;$D$&quot;,4*dir(140),dir(180)); label(&quot;$R$&quot;,5*dir(55),dir(80)); label(&quot;$S$&quot;,7.5*dir(0),dir(-25)); label(&quot;$4$&quot;,2*dir(140),dir(230)); label(&quot;$5$&quot;,2.5*dir(55),dir(155)); label(&quot;$6$&quot;,(4*dir(140)+5*dir(55))/2,dir(100)); label(&quot;$7\\frac{1}{2}$&quot;,3.75,dir(-90)); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"135\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/0/9f0d1801aa1836ce4fca5fab23bb846e0990b6cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{SF}{RD} = \\frac{FR}{DF} = \\frac{5}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"131\" height=\"39\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/6/c1696f5f8dd385ed7f145f82e7cd0d17bad5ba73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle SFR = \\angle RDF$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"136\" height=\"14\" />, by SAS similarity <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/3/56363aac41a03b97eab145e7288a4c9706689c24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle SFR \\sim \\triangle RDF$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"142\" height=\"18\" />.  \n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/1/8a10c1a49495a1da6900d8125172c0680e80799e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{RS}{FR} = \\frac{5}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"71\" height=\"39\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/4/8144c0b9041e8d6a37fbc9132610cca36d418f43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$RS = \\frac{5}{4}FR = \\frac{5}{4} \\cdot 5 = \\frac{25}{4} = \\boxed{ \\textbf{(E)}  \\ 6\\frac{1}{4}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"290\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p><p>-edited by j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/5/e7565f503ec4ea41f67649b145f7d349864ca444.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle RFS = \\angle FDR = \\theta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"169\" height=\"14\" />. By Cosine Law, we have:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/5/de5c0b83aea8181322add67f80aef4fdd7b8212d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} RF^2 &amp;= DR^2 + DF^2 - 2(DR)(DF)cos(\\theta) \\\\ 5^2 &amp;= 6^2 + 4^2 - 2(6)(4)cos(\\theta) \\\\ cos(\\theta) &amp;= \\frac{6^2+4^2-5^2}{2(6)(4)} = \\frac{9}{16} \\end{align*}\" width=\"334\" height=\"99\" />\nApplying Cosine Law again in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/7/b67d64f9b4b25a32aa78b7dc3e1c9b9942378a82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle RFS$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"58\" height=\"18\" />, we have:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/4/b54e7bfb5e439cd6083203e2f80d25d973d5f5e1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} RS^2 &amp;= RF^2 + FS^2 - 2(RF)(FS)cos(\\theta) \\\\ RS^2 &amp;= 25 + (\\frac{15}{2})^2 - 2(5)(\\frac{15}{2})(\\frac{9}{16}) \\\\ RS^2 &amp;= \\frac{625}{16} \\end{align*}\" width=\"310\" height=\"108\" />\ngiving us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/1/f910e56b40a605125238d182c3ec1420726180bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$RS = \\frac{25}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"74\" height=\"38\" />, which is the answer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/f/6bfc0829f3f29bbf35d0a861644e00cfef0f50ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"39\" height=\"28\" />. -nullptr07\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME\" title=\"1964 AHSME\">1964 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1964 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1964\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">Problem 28</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">Problem 30</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•<